  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1274",
    "issue_date": "2026-08-01T02:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-01T02:37:26.720Z",
    "meteorologist": "Sanjib Adhikari",
    "analysis_np": "हाल देशभर मनसुनी वायुको प्रभाव रहेको छ। हाल मनसुनको न्यून चापीय रेखा पश्चिममा सरदर स्थानको आसपास तथा पूर्वमा सरदर स्थानभन्दा केेही उत्तरतर्फ रहेको छ।",
    "analysis_en": "Currently, monsoon winds are influencing the entire country. The Monsoon Trough is positioned around its normal location in the west and slightly north of its normal location in the east.",
    "today_np": "देशभर साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ। देशका हिमाली भू-भागका केही स्थानमा मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। पहाडी भू-भागका धेरै स्थानमा तथा तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ। बागमती, गण्डकी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका पहाडी भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना छ ।",
    "today_en": "The weather will be generally cloudy across the country. There is a possibility of light to moderate rain or snowfall at some places in the Himalayan region, while light to moderate rain accompanied by thunder and lightning is expected at many places in the hilly regions and at some places in the Terai region. Heavy rainfall is likely at one or two places in the hilly regions of Bagmati, Gandaki, Karnali, and Sudurpashchim Provinces.",
    "tomorrow_np": "देशभर साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ। देशको हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका केही तथा तराई भू-भागका धेरै स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ।  कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशका हिमाली, पहाडी र तराई भू-भाग तथा लुम्बिनी र सुदुरपश्चिम प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा भारी वर्षाको सम्भावना छ ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "The conditions will remain generally cloudy nationwide. Light to moderate rain accompanied by thunder and lightning is expected at many places in the Terai region and at some places in the hilly and Himalayan regions. Heavy rainfall is likely at one or two places in the Himalayan, hilly, and Terai regions of Koshi, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces, as well as the Terai regions of Lumbini and Sudurpashchim Provinces.",
    "special": ""
  }
